o came in fury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l021","ordinal":176027,"en":"Leveling his spear at Toltoy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l022","ordinal":176028,"en":"Behind Külchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l023","ordinal":176029,"en":"The trumpet deafened the ears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l024","ordinal":176030,"en":"The brass horn clattered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l025","ordinal":176031,"en":"And the drum boomed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l026","ordinal":176032,"en":"Dust rose into the sky,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l027","ordinal":176033,"en":"Cloud striking cloud,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l028","ordinal":176034,"en":"They raised a din crying “Khan Manas!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l029","ordinal":176035,"en":"All the sons of khans"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l030","ordinal":176036,"en":"Raised a clamor as they entered the host."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l031","ordinal":176037,"en":"Shouting, they thrust their spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l032","ordinal":176038,"en":"And many men fell in battle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l033","ordinal":176039,"en":"They grappled and fought,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l034","ordinal":176040,"en":"Leaving ruin all around."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l035","ordinal":176041,"en":"Baitaylak, son of Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l036","ordinal":176042,"en":"Came shouting from the front,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l037","ordinal":176043,"en":"And Kalyk of Sary Khan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l038","ordinal":176044,"en":"Drove in, scattering the foe."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1307:b005:l039","ordinal":176045,"en":"Jamgyrchy's Shayyimbet"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l001","ordinal":176046,"en":"Struck again and swept them down."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l002","ordinal":176047,"en":"From the flank, Kanchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l003","ordinal":176048,"en":"Girding his keen waist,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l004","ordinal":176049,"en":"Entered the Jediger host"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l005","ordinal":176050,"en":"Alone and laid hands upon them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l006","ordinal":176051,"en":"The warriors wearied of combat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l007","ordinal":176052,"en":"And their pine-like spears"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l008","ordinal":176053,"en":"Were driven into living hearts."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l009","ordinal":176054,"en":"Corpses of warriors piled like a mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l010","ordinal":176055,"en":"And all the spears fell in bundles."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l011","ordinal":176056,"en":"Battle-axes shrieked,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l012","ordinal":176057,"en":"And all the swords shattered."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l013","ordinal":176058,"en":"Much ground was now filled with blood;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l014","ordinal":176059,"en":"It became a fierce battle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l015","ordinal":176060,"en":"Shouting, they thrust their spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l016","ordinal":176061,"en":"And when spears could not reach,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l017","ordinal":176062,"en":"They fought with guns."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l018","ordinal":176063,"en":"A pale haze of dust arose,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l019","ordinal":176064,"en":"The open field became black blood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l020","ordinal":176065,"en":"And many people met their end."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l021","ordinal":176066,"en":"Roaring in fury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l022","ordinal":176067,"en":"At all the Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l023","ordinal":176068,"en":"Külchoro, born of the keen one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l024","ordinal":176069,"en":"Charged and scattered them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l025","ordinal":176070,"en":"From the Afghan city,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l026","ordinal":176071,"en":"Making the Jediger cry out,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l027","ordinal":176072,"en":"He drove them out and swept them away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l028","ordinal":176073,"en":"While your falcons were present,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l029","ordinal":176074,"en":"They wrought astounding havoc,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l030","ordinal":176075,"en":"And when Afghanistan was about to perish,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l031","ordinal":176076,"en":"They tore it free."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l032","ordinal":176077,"en":"Kanchoro carved through their center"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l033","ordinal":176078,"en":"And came out the other side;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l034","ordinal":176079,"en":"Baitaylak destroyed one wing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l035","ordinal":176080,"en":"And came out the other side."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l036","ordinal":176081,"en":"Kalyk spread wide on the edge"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l037","ordinal":176082,"en":"And came enclosing it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l038","ordinal":176083,"en":"In that remarkable battle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b003:l039","ordinal":176084,"en":"All those sons of khans"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l001","ordinal":176085,"en":"Came plundering through."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l002","ordinal":176086,"en":"The horses were gathered as spoil,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l003","ordinal":176087,"en":"And the Jediger people were slaughtered."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l004","ordinal":176088,"en":"The warriors' heads were cut off,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l005","ordinal":176089,"en":"The lords' bellies were ripped open,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l006","ordinal":176090,"en":"And the surging Jediger host"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l007","ordinal":176091,"en":"Was wholly broken apart."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l008","ordinal":176092,"en":"The warriors who had boasted of strength"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l009","ordinal":176093,"en":"Dismounted and ran,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l010","ordinal":176094,"en":"Putting their belts around their necks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l011","ordinal":176095,"en":"And pulling their horses forward."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l012","ordinal":176096,"en":"Those who remained alive"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l013","ordinal":176097,"en":"Cast down their spears and sobbed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l014","ordinal":176098,"en":"Crying together, “We surrender!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l015","ordinal":176099,"en":"The common people gathered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l016","ordinal":176100,"en":"Their leaders having been slain;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l017","ordinal":176101,"en":"The wicked begged for mercy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l018","ordinal":176102,"en":"And the good had been beheaded."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l019","ordinal":176103,"en":"Threatening to seize their wives,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l020","ordinal":176104,"en":"They drove them frantic with deceit;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l021","ordinal":176105,"en":"The devastated Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l022","ordinal":176106,"en":"Scattered all their possessions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l023","ordinal":176107,"en":"The captured Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l024","ordinal":176108,"en":"Saw what they had never seen;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l025","ordinal":176109,"en":"Innocent, meek people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l026","ordinal":176110,"en":"Fell in rows and died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l027","ordinal":176111,"en":"And saw the place of Judgment."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l028","ordinal":176112,"en":"Intending to bring death,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l029","ordinal":176113,"en":"They scattered their own possessions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l030","ordinal":176114,"en":"Let us leave that matter thus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l031","ordinal":176115,"en":"And begin the tale of Toltoy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l032","ordinal":176116,"en":"Khan of the Jediger:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l033","ordinal":176117,"en":"Was Toltoy not a warrior?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l034","ordinal":176118,"en":"Toltoy learned then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l035","ordinal":176119,"en":"That Semetey and Choro"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l036","ordinal":176120,"en":"Were absent."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l037","ordinal":176121,"en":"Using brute force, he slaughtered the people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l038","ordinal":176122,"en":"And Toltoy drove them before him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1308:b004:l039","ordinal":176123,"en":"Before anyone could say a word,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1309:b003:l001","ordinal":176124,"en":"In the blink of an eye,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1309:b003:l002","ordinal":176125,"en":"Brave Toltoy did whatever he wished"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1309:b003:l003","ordinal":176126,"en":"To Afghanistan."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1309:b003:l004","ordinal":176127,"en":"Poor Toltoy then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1309:b003:l005","ordinal":176128,"en":"Began the turmoil,"}]
